#: main.cpp:144
msgid ""
"<h1>Window Behavior</h1> Here you can customize the way windows behave when "
"being moved, resized or clicked on. You can also specify a focus policy as "
"well as a placement policy for new windows. "
"<p>"
"Please note that this configuration will not take effect if you don't use "
"KWin as your window manager. If you do use a different window manager, "
"please refer to its documentation for how to customize window behavior."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Venster Gedrag</h1> Hier jy kan pasmaak die weg vensters gedra wanneer "
"te wees verskuif, hervergroot of gekliek het op. jy kan asook spesifiseer 'n "
"fokus beleid as goed as 'n plasing beleid vir nuwe vensters. "
"<p>Asseblief nota wat hierdie opstelling sal nie neem effek as jy moet nie "
"gebruik Kwin as jou Venster bestuurder. as jy doen gebruik 'n ander Venster "
"bestuurder, Asseblief verwys na sy dokumentasie vir hoe na pasmaak Venster "
"Gedrag."

