#: windows.cpp:174
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, a window in the background will automatically "
"come to the front when the mouse pointer has been over it for some time."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, 'n venster in die agtergrond sal "
"automaties kom na die voor Wanneer die muis wyser het al bo dit vir sommige "
"tyd."

#: windows.cpp:176
msgid ""
"This is the delay after which the window that the mouse pointer is over will "
"automatically come to the front."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die vertraging na wat die venster wat die muis wyser is bo sal "
"automaties kom na die voor."

#: windows.cpp:180
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, your windows will be brought to the front when "
"you click somewhere into the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, jou vensters sal wees bring na die voor "
"Wanneer jy kliek êrens binnein die venster inhoud."

#: windows.cpp:185
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigering"

#: windows.cpp:190
msgid "Walk through windows mode:"
msgstr "Stap deur vensters modus:"

#: windows.cpp:192
msgid "&KDE"
msgstr "Kde"

#: windows.cpp:194
msgid "CD&E"
msgstr "Cde"

#: windows.cpp:197
msgid ""
"Hold down the Alt key and press the Tab key repeatedly to walk through the "
"windows on the current desktop (the Alt+Tab combination can be "
"reconfigured). The two different modes mean:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>KDE</b>: a nice widget is shown, displaying the icons of all windows "
"to walk through and the title of the currently selected one;"
"<li><b>CDE</b>: the focus is passed to a new window each time Tab is "
"pressed. No fancy widget.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Hou ondertoe die Alt sleutel en druk die Oortjie sleutel herhaaldelik na "
"stap deur die vensters op die huidige werkskerm (die Alt+Oortjie kombinasie "
"kan wees geherkonfigureer). die twee ander modusse "
"beteken:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Kde</b>: 'n oulike gui-element is vertoon, vertooning die ikoone van "
"alle vensters na stap deur en die titel van die huidiglik gekose "
"een;"
"<li><b>Cde</b>"
": die fokus is aanstuur na 'n nuwe venster elke tyd Oortjie is gedruk. Nee "
"deftige gui-element.</li></ul>"

#: windows.cpp:208
msgid "&Traverse windows on all desktops"
msgstr "Versprei vensters op alle werkskerms"

#: windows.cpp:212
msgid ""
"Leave this option disabled if you want to limit walking through windows to "
"the current desktop."
msgstr ""
"Los hierdie opsie gestremde as jy wil hê na beperk stap deur vensters na "
"die huidige werkskerm."

#: windows.cpp:216
msgid "Desktop navi&gation wraps around"
msgstr "Werkskerm navigering omvou omtrent"

#: windows.cpp:219
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want keyboard or electric border navigation beyond "
"an edge desktop to bring you to the desktop at the opposite edge."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer hierdie opsie as jy wil hê sleutelbord of elektriese grens "
"navigering verby 'n rand werkskerm na bring jy na die werkskerm na die "
"teenoorgestelde rand."

#: windows.cpp:223
msgid "Popup desktop name on desktop &switch"
msgstr "Opspring werkskerm naam op werkskerm wissel"

#: windows.cpp:226
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you wish to see the current desktop name popup "
"whenever the current desktop is changed."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer hierdie opsie as jy wens na sien die huidige werkskerm naam "
"opspring wanneer ook al die huidige werkskerm is het verander."

#: windows.cpp:461
msgid "Shading"
msgstr "Skadu"

#: windows.cpp:463
msgid "Anima&te"
msgstr "Animeer"

#: windows.cpp:464
msgid ""
"Animate the action of reducing the window to its titlebar (shading) as well "
"as the expansion of a shaded window"
msgstr ""
"Animeer die aksie van verminder die venster na sy titelbar (skadu) as goed "
"as die uitbreiding van 'n gedeel venster"

#: windows.cpp:467
msgid "&Enable hover"
msgstr "Aktiveer sweef"

#: windows.cpp:477
msgid ""
"If Shade Hover is enabled, a shaded window will un-shade automatically when "
"the mouse pointer has been over the title bar for some time."
msgstr ""
"As Skadu Sweef is geaktiveer, 'n gedeel venster sal un-Skadu automaties "
"wanneer die muis wyser het al bo die titel kolom vir sommige tyd."

#: windows.cpp:480
msgid ""
"Sets the time in milliseconds before the window unshades when the mouse "
"pointer goes over the shaded window."
msgstr ""
"Verstel die tyd in millisekondes voor die venster ontskadu wanneer die muis "
"wyser gaan bo die gedeel venster."

#: windows.cpp:492
msgid "Xinerama"
msgstr "Xinerama"

#: windows.cpp:494
msgid "Enable Xinerama support"
msgstr "Aktiveer Xinerama ondersteun"

#: windows.cpp:495
msgid "Enable support for Xinerama."
msgstr "Aktiveer ondersteun vir Xinerama."

#: windows.cpp:497
msgid "Enable window resistance support"
msgstr "Aktiveer venster weerstand ondersteun"

#: windows.cpp:498
msgid ""
"Turn on resistance when moving a window from one physical screen to the "
"other."
msgstr ""
"Skakel op weerstand wanneer beweeg 'n venster van een fisiese skerm na die "
"ander."

#: windows.cpp:499
msgid "Enable window placement support"
msgstr "Aktiveer venster plasing ondersteun"

#: windows.cpp:500
msgid ""
"This option opens new windows on the physical screen on which the cursor is "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie opsie maak oop nuwe vensters op die fisiese skerm op wat die "
"plekaanduier is voordra."

#: windows.cpp:501
msgid "Enable window maximize support"
msgstr "Aktiveer venster maksimeer ondersteun"

#: windows.cpp:502
msgid ""
"When this option is turned on, windows will only maximize up to the physical "
"screen size."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie opsie is geskakel op, vensters sal slegs maksimeer begin na "
"die fisiese skerm grootte."

#: windows.cpp:507
msgid "Active Desktop Borders"
msgstr "Aktief Werkskerm Grense"

#: windows.cpp:510
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, moving the mouse to a screen border will change "
"your desktop. This is e.g. useful if you want to drag windows from one "
"desktop to the other."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, beweeg die muis na 'n skerm grens sal "
"verander jou werkskerm. hierdie is e.g. bruikbare As jy wil hê na trek "
"vensters van een werkskerm na die ander."

#: windows.cpp:513
msgid "D&isabled"
msgstr "Gestremde"

#: windows.cpp:514
msgid "Only &when moving windows"
msgstr "Slegs wanneer beweeg vensters"

#: windows.cpp:515
msgid "A&lways enabled"
msgstr "Altyd geaktiveer"

#: windows.cpp:520
msgid "Desktop &switch delay:"
msgstr "Werkskerm wissel vertraging:"

#: windows.cpp:521
msgid ""
"Here you can set a delay for switching desktops using the active borders "
"feature. Desktops will be switched after the mouse has been pushed against a "
"screen border for the specified number of milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan stel 'n vertraging vir omskakeling werkskerms te gebruik die "
"aktief grense funksie. werkskerms sal wees geskakel na die muis het al "
"gestoot teen 'n skerm grens vir die gespesifiseer nommer van millisekondes."

#: windows.cpp:692
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Vensters"

#: windows.cpp:701
msgid "Di&splay content in moving windows"
msgstr "Vertoon inhoud in beweeg vensters"

#: windows.cpp:703
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be fully shown while "
"moving it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not "
"be satisfying on slow machines without graphic acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer hierdie opsie as jy wil hê 'n venster se inhoud na wees volledig "
"vertoon terwyl beweeg dit, in plaas van van net te wys 'n venster "
"'skeleton'. Die resultaat dalk mag nie wees bevredigend op stadige masjiene "
"sonder om te grafiek versnelling."

#: windows.cpp:707
msgid "Display content in &resizing windows"
msgstr "Vertoon inhoud in hervergrooting vensters"

#: windows.cpp:709
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a window's content to be shown while resizing "
"it, instead of just showing a window 'skeleton'. The result may not be "
"satisfying on slow machines."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer hierdie opsie as jy wil hê 'n venster se inhoud na wees vertoon "
"terwyl hervergrooting dit, in plaas van van net te wys 'n venster "
"'skeleton'. Die resultaat dalk mag nie wees bevredigend op stadige masjiene."

#: windows.cpp:718
msgid "Animate minimi&ze and restore"
msgstr "Animeer minimeer en herstel"

#: windows.cpp:720
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want an animation shown when windows are minimized "
"or restored."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer hierdie opsie as jy wil hê 'n animasie vertoon wanneer vensters "
"word geminimeer of gerestoreer."

#: windows.cpp:734
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "Stadige"

#: windows.cpp:738
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Vinnige"

#: windows.cpp:742
msgid ""
"Here you can set the speed of the animation shown when windows are minimized "
"and restored. "
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan stel die spoed van die animasie vertoon wanneer vensters word "
"geminimeer en gerestoreer. "

#: windows.cpp:748
msgid "Allow moving and resizing o&f maximized windows"
msgstr "Toelaat beweeg en hervergrooting van maksimeerd vensters"

#: windows.cpp:750
msgid ""
"When enabled, this feature activates the border of maximized windows and "
"allows you to move or resize them, just like for normal windows"
msgstr ""
"Wanneer geaktiveer, hierdie funksie aktiveer die grens van maksimeerd "
"vensters en laat toe jy na beweeg of hervergroot hulle, net hou van vir "
"normale vensters"

#: windows.cpp:756
msgid "&Placement:"
msgstr "Plasing:"

#: windows.cpp:759
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "Luukse"

#: windows.cpp:760
msgid "Cascade"
msgstr "Kaskade"

#: windows.cpp:761
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Lukrake"

#: windows.cpp:762
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "Gesentreer"

#: windows.cpp:763
msgid "Zero-Cornered"
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:770
msgid ""
"The placement policy determines where a new window will appear on the "
"desktop. For now, there are three different policies: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Smart</em> will try to achieve a minimum overlap of windows</li> "
"<li><em>Cascade</em> will cascade the windows</li> "
"<li><em>Random</em> will use a random position</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Die plasing beleid bepaal waar 'n nuwe venster sal verskyn op Die werkskerm. "
"Vir nou, daar word drie ander beleid: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Luukse</em> sal probeer na bereik 'n minimum oorvleuel van "
"vensters</li> "
"<li><em>Kaskade</em> sal Kaskade Die vensters</li> "
"<li><em>Lukrake</em> sal gebruik 'n Lukrake posisie</li></ul>"

#: windows.cpp:802
msgid "Snap Zones"
msgstr "Spring Sones"

#: windows.cpp:806 windows.cpp:816
msgid "none"
msgstr "geen"

#: windows.cpp:808
msgid "&Border snap zone:"
msgstr "Grens spring sone:"

#: windows.cpp:809 windows.cpp:819
msgid " pixels"
msgstr " beeld elemente"

#: windows.cpp:811
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for screen borders, i.e. the 'strength' of "
"the magnetic field which will make windows snap to the border when moved "
"near it."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan stel die spring sone vir skerm grense, i.e. die 'strength' van "
"die magneties veld wat sal maak vensters spring na die grens wanneer "
"verskuif naby dit."

#: windows.cpp:818
msgid "&Window snap zone:"
msgstr "Venster spring sone:"

#: windows.cpp:821
msgid ""
"Here you can set the snap zone for windows, i.e. the 'strength' of the "
"magnetic field which will make windows snap to each other when they're moved "
"near another window."
msgstr ""

#: windows.cpp:825
msgid "Snap windows onl&y when overlapping"
msgstr "Spring vensters slegs wanneer oorvleuel"

#: windows.cpp:826
msgid ""
"Here you can set that windows will be only snapped if you try to overlap "
"them, i.e. they won't be snapped if the windows comes only near another "
"window or border."
msgstr ""
